box_651_258_1072_499.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"35%\" /></div>\n\n\n## DÍ\n\n尊重自己，\n\n做和阳光一样美丽的人\n\n## 01\n\n## 生活\n\n1. 抢劫\n\n2. 盗窃\n\n3. 网络诈骗\n\n4. 交通安全\n\n5. 品行\n\n6. 休假外出\n\n## 02\n\n## 工作\n\n1. 安全\n\n2. 抢劫\n\n3. 盗窃\n\n4. 人身伤害\n\n5. 卖场突发事件\n\n## 目录：\n\n## 一、 生活篇", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_651_258_1072_499.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//626da922-27a2-4c8a-b347-0fab89f6a8ad/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_651_258_1072_499.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A12Z%2F-1%2F%2F81ad2043471c9a63c02ef204743cc1c648b2c1141730e7ec8beb3a9db2f68590", "imgs/img_in_header_image_box_938_593_1123_642.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//626da922-27a2-4c8a-b347-0fab89f6a8ad/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_938_593_1123_642.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A12Z%2F-1%2F%2F54f32db1ab1b0258457bede4896d464a10e2f945421c343a66e3556090c36134", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_938_1211_1123_1257.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//626da922-27a2-4c8a-b347-0fab89f6a8ad/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_938_1211_1123_1257.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A13Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa74c7f92d387f911906711f19dc00f0563b9a3a986488f0985ef7f621d649555"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//626da922-27a2-4c8a-b347-0fab89f6a8ad/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A13Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff6088a222abb0905d9b088846b5fc98ed657ed7815f6674ada6e6c73e2228f4a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//626da922-27a2-4c8a-b347-0fab89f6a8ad/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOq